==Major events==
{{spoilers}}
===''[[JNS01|The Arceus Chronicles (Part 1)]]''===
* {{Ash}} and [[Goh]] travel to [[Sinnoh]] again and reunite with {{an|Dawn}} and {{an|Cynthia}}.
* [[Team Galactic]] returns, planning to bring back [[Cyrus]].
* [[Saturn]] catches a {{p|Heatran}}.
* Ash, Dawn, and Goh learn about [[Hisui|Sinnoh's past]].
* Ash, Dawn, and Goh temporarily catch a {{p|Rowlet}}, an {{p|Oshawott}}, and a {{p|Cyndaquil}}, respectively.

===''[[JNS02|The Arceus Chronicles (Part 2)]]''===
* {{Ash}} and {{an|Dawn}} reunite with {{an|Brock}}, with [[Goh]] meeting him for the first time.
* Brock's {{p|Chansey}} is revealed to have evolved into {{TP|Brock|Blissey}}. 
* [[Team Galactic]] begins to open a portal to bring back [[Cyrus]].
* [[Saturn]]'s {{p|Heatran}} goes on a rampage and escapes.
* Ash, Brock, and Dawn encounter Team Galactic again, while Goh encounters them for the first time.

===''[[JNS03|The Arceus Chronicles (Part 3)]]''===
* [[Brock's Blissey]] is revealed to have learned {{m|Dazzling Gleam}} and {{m|Mega Punch}}.
* {{an|Brock}} meets {{an|Cynthia}} again.
* Cynthia is revealed to own a {{p|Roserade}}.
* {{p|Arceus}} appears to stop the rampaging {{p|Heatran}}.

===''[[JNS04|The Arceus Chronicles (Part 4)]]''===
* The portal above [[Mount Coronet]] is closed and the rampaging {{p|Heatran}} is stopped.
* The [[Team Galactic]] {{tc|Commander}}s are rearrested, ending their plan to bring back [[Cyrus]].
* {{Ash}} and [[Goh]] return to [[Vermilion City]].
{{endspoilers}}

